WEBVTT

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:10.300
This is FynHelp, month-end close software built for Indian CA firms.

00:00:10.764 --> 00:00:15.143
Clients' documents come in, books are matched, and a source-linked MIS goes out.

00:00:18.676 --> 00:00:20.641
Plans are priced per active client, with unlimited users on every plan.

00:00:20.761 --> 00:00:24.390
Pay yearly and you get two months free.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:27.130
Type how many clients you close in a month...

00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:29.333
...and FynHelp picks the cheapest plan for you.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:39.600
Sign up takes a minute. No card needed.

00:00:41.432 --> 00:00:47.432
Name the firm and its city.

00:00:47.599 --> 00:00:53.599
Add the first client: Sundara Textiles.

00:00:54.615 --> 00:00:57.832
The client's WhatsApp number lets documents they send be filed automatically.

00:00:57.952 --> 00:01:01.675
Drop in September's HDFC bank statement. The free trial starts now.

00:01:01.795 --> 00:01:04.953
Extract reads every line in seconds. Anything unclear is kept aside for review.

00:01:05.073 --> 00:01:07.230
Everything for this client lives in one workspace.

00:01:07.350 --> 00:01:08.962
Switch the period to September, the month we are closing.

00:01:10.414 --> 00:01:16.093
Now the books side: a Tally day book export. Nothing to install.

00:01:16.213 --> 00:01:18.942
Recon starts by itself as soon as both sides of the month are in.

00:01:22.736 --> 00:01:24.390
Exact matches first, then close matches, then your firm's own rules.

00:01:24.510 --> 00:01:27.830
A Stripe payout in US dollars needs a person, and FynHelp says why.

00:01:27.950 --> 00:01:30.821
Discard it, or correct it once and FynHelp remembers next month.

00:01:32.791 --> 00:01:35.353
Exceptions come with the suggested match and the evidence beside it.

00:01:35.473 --> 00:01:41.473
₹40,000 received against ₹50,000 billed: record it as a part payment, with a note.

00:01:42.635 --> 00:01:48.635
Decide the rest. Every decision is kept on the audit trail.

00:01:53.408 --> 00:01:58.821
With no exceptions open, the client is ready for its MIS.

00:01:58.941 --> 00:02:04.941
The MIS is built only from matched transactions.

00:02:06.733 --> 00:02:12.612
Click any figure to see the exact bank lines behind it.

00:02:13.561 --> 00:02:15.871
The partner reviews and signs off.

00:02:15.991 --> 00:02:20.135
Signed off. That is September closed, start to finish.

00:02:27.900 --> 00:02:33.900
Missing a document? Create a chase for it.

00:02:38.413 --> 00:02:43.253
The Chaser emails the client a polite reminder in the firm's name.

00:02:43.373 --> 00:02:49.373
When the invoice arrives...

00:02:53.504 --> 00:02:56.726
...the chase closes by itself.

00:03:03.274 --> 00:03:09.274
Next month, documents arrive on their own. Connect the firm's Gmail once.

00:03:10.691 --> 00:03:16.691
FynHelp checks the inbox on a schedule, reading only email from known clients.

00:03:31.117 --> 00:03:37.117
Ramesh emailed October's HDFC statement. It was filed under his company by itself.

00:03:37.681 --> 00:03:43.681
Clients can also send statements on WhatsApp.

00:03:45.813 --> 00:03:49.537
Link the firm's official WhatsApp Business number.

00:03:49.657 --> 00:03:55.657
Ramesh sends his Axis statement from his phone...

00:04:03.302 --> 00:04:08.880
...and it is matched to Sundara Textiles by his number and read at once.

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:15.000
On Zoho Books? Connect it, read-only. FynHelp never changes anything in Zoho.

00:04:16.504 --> 00:04:22.504
Map the client to its Zoho organisation and bank account.

00:04:27.393 --> 00:04:33.393
Pull October's books side.

00:04:44.323 --> 00:04:48.369
Recon matches Zoho's books against the emailed bank statement automatically.

00:04:52.366 --> 00:04:56.827
Every morning, one screen shows what needs you and what the agents did.

00:04:56.947 --> 00:05:02.947
Press Command K to find anything or run an agent.

00:05:07.126 --> 00:05:13.126
Invite the whole team. Partners sign off, juniors prepare.

00:05:20.223 --> 00:05:23.384
You see this month's active clients and documents as you go.

00:05:23.504 --> 00:05:24.704
Choose a plan when you are ready. Payment is through Razorpay.

00:05:24.374 --> 00:05:28.559
The plan is active. Clients you don't work on in a month are free.
